<title>DENMARK: Rieber boosts Phoenix stake further.</title>
<headline>Rieber boosts Phoenix stake further.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Rieber &amp; Son bought up the shareholdings of two leading Danish pension funds in takeover target Phoenix Contractors on Thursday.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
